,"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1 and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" then the answer is 0. If "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1 and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≠ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≠ 1 and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" then answer is |"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pos"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"| + 1 or |"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pos"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"| + 1 respectively. And in the other case (when "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≠ 1 and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" ≠ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":") the answer is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"min"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"(|"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pos"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"l"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"|, |"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pos"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"r"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"|) + 2."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"problem_section"},{"attrs":{"problemCode":"915C"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://codeforces.com/contest/915/problem/C"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"915C - Permute Digits"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's construct the answer digit by digit starting from the leftmost. Obviously, we are asked to build lexicographically maximal answer so in this order we should choose the greatest digit on each step."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Precalc "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cnt"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" — number of digits "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" in number "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Iterate over all possible digits starting from the greatest. For each digit check if it's possible to put it in this position. For this you construct minimal suffix (greedily put the lowest digit) and compare the resulting number with number "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". If it became less or equal then proceed to the next digit."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Overall complexity: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"(|"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"|"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text"